          <div class="mini type-c"><p class="t" style="font-size:15px">Run your whole facility on one platform.</p><p class="t bn-c" style="font-size:15px;margin-top:4px;line-height:1.4">আপনার পুরো প্রতিষ্ঠান, এক প্ল্যাটফর্মে।</p><p class="m" style="margin-top:6px;font-size:10.5px">Online appointments are live today and free to start. Serial <span class="num">12</span>, <span class="num">10:40</span>, Room <span class="num">3</span>.</p><p class="m bn-c" style="font-size:10.5px">অনলাইন অ্যাপয়েন্টমেন্ট আজই চালু, বিনামূল্যে শুরু করুন।</p></div>
          <h3>3. Hanken Grotesk + Noto Sans Bengali <small>Both variable</small></h3>
          <p>Neutral and institutional, the most "hospital" of the three. Noto Sans Bengali is the safest renderer of conjuncts.</p>
          <button class="choose" type="button">Choose Y-3</button>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="pick" data-key="badge">
      <h2>19. The "Available now" badge</h2>
      <p>Decision D6. Always a check and the words, never color alone. Shown beside the Early access badge it must differ from.</p>
      <div class="cards">
        <article class="card" data-code="B-1">
          <div class="mini" style="display:grid;place-items:center"><div class="row" style="gap:8px;align-items:center"><span class="chip" style="font-size:11px;padding:4px 10px">Appointments <span class="badge g" set:html={check + ' Available now, free'}></span></span><span class="chip" style="font-size:11px;padding:4px 10px">Billing <span class="badge m">Early access</span></span></div></div>
          <h3>1. Calm Green outline <small>The brief's rule</small></h3>
          <p>Green means available, mist means early access, as the brief wrote it. Green and aqua are close in hue, so the check and the words do the work.</p>
          <button class="choose" type="button">Choose B-1</button>
        </article>
        <article class="card" data-code="B-2">
          <div class="mini" style="display:grid;place-items:center"><div class="row" style="gap:8px;align-items:center"><span class="chip" style="font-size:11px;padding:4px 10px">Appointments <span class="badge i" set:html={check + ' Available now, free'}></span></span><span class="chip" style="font-size:11px;padding:4px 10px">Billing <span class="badge m">Early access</span></span></div></div>
          <h3>2. Ink fill, pale aqua text</h3>
          <p>Brand-colored and unmistakable against mist. Departs from the brief's green-means-live rule; the words carry the meaning either way.</p>
          <button class="choose" type="button">Choose B-2</button>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="pick" data-key="stickybar">
      <h2>20. Sticky mobile bar</h2>
      <p>The bottom bar that always shows the primary action on phones.</p>
      <div class="cards">
        <article class="card" data-code="K-1">
          <div class="mini" style="display:flex;align-items:flex-end"><div class="row" style="width:100%;background:#fff;border-top:1px solid var(--mist);padding:6px;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center"><span class="m">Diagnostic centre or hospital?</span><span class="b">Book a demo</span></div></div>
          <h3>1. One label, always</h3>
          <p>Book a demo everywhere. The facility sale is the headline metric; nothing competes with it.</p>
          <button class="choose" type="button">Choose K-1</button>
        </article>
        <article class="card" data-code="K-2">
          <div class="mini" style="display:flex;align-items:flex-end"><div class="row" style="width:100%;background:#fff;border-top:1px solid var(--mist);padding:6px;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center"><span class="m">In the doctor sections</span><span class="b o" style="color:var(--teal-700)">Start free with Appointments</span></div></div>
          <h3>2. Context-aware label</h3>
          <p>Book a demo by default, Start free while the appointment and doctor sections are in view. Each reader always sees their own door.</p>
          <button class="choose" type="button">Choose K-2</button>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>

  <div class="picksbar" role="region" aria-label="Your picks">
    <span><b id="count">0 of 20</b> rows picked</span>
    <code id="codes">No picks yet</code>
    <button id="copy" type="button">Copy picks</button>
  </div>

  <style>
    .wrap { max-width: 1180px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 24px 16px 40px; }
    .intro { display: grid; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 8px; }
    .intro h1 { font-size: 28px; }
    .intro p { color: var(--fg-muted); max-width: 72ch; }
    .pick { margin: 48px 0 0; }
    .pick h2 { font-size: 22px; margin-bottom: 4px; }
    .pick > p { color: var(--fg-muted); max-width: 72ch; margin-bottom: 14px; }
    .cards { display: grid; gap: 16px; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr)); }
    .card { border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 16px; padding: 12px; background: #fff; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; }
    .card.quiet { background: var(--wash-50); }
    .card.sel { box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px var(--marigold); }
    .card h3 { font-size: 15px; }
    .card h3 small { display: block; font-weight: 500; color: var(--fg-muted); font-size: 12px; margin-top: 2px; }
    .card p { font-size: 13px; color: var(--fg-muted); }
    .card .risk { color: var(--ink-950); font-size: 12.5px; }
    .choose { margin-top: auto; align-self: flex-start; border: 1px solid var(--teal-700); color: var(--teal-700); background: transparent; border-radius: 10px; padding: 10px 14px; font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer; min-height: 44px; }
    .choose:hover { background: var(--wash-100); }
    .card.sel .choose { background: var(--marigold); border-color: var(--marigold); color: var(--ink-950); }
    .mini { position: relative; aspect-ratio: 16 / 10; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; background: var(--paper); border: 1px solid var(--line); padding: 10px; font-size: 10px; line-height: 1.3; color: var(--ink-950); }
    .mini.ink { background: var(--ink-950); color: #F2FBFA; border-color: var(--ink-800); }
    .mini.boardbg { background-image: linear-gradient(var(--ink-800) 1px, transparent 1px), linear-gradient(90deg, var(--ink-800) 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 14px 14px; }
    .mini .t { font-weight: 700; font-size: 12.5px; letter-spacing: -0.02em; line-height: 1.15; text-wrap: balance; }
    .mini .m { color: var(--slate); font-size: 9.5px; }
    .mini.ink .m { color: var(--mist-on-ink); }
    .mini .b { display: inline-block; padding: 3px 7px; border-radius: 5px; background: var(--marigold); color: var(--ink-950); font-weight: 700; font-size: 9px; white-space: nowrap; }
    .mini .b.o { background: transparent; border: 1px solid currentColor; color: inherit; }
    .mini .row { display: flex; gap: 6px; align-items: flex-start; }
    .mini .col { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; }
    .mini .tile { border-radius: 4px; background: var(--wash-100); border: 1px solid var(--mist); padding: 4px 5px; }
    .mini.ink .tile { background: var(--ink-900); border-color: var(--ink-800); }
    .mini .chip { display: inline-block; border: 1px solid var(--mist); border-radius: 99px; padding: 1px 6px; font-size: 8.5px; margin: 1px; background: #fff; }
    .mini.ink .chip { background: transparent; border-color: var(--ink-800); }
    .mini .chip.on { border-color: var(--green); color: var(--green); font-weight: 700; }
    .mini .board { background: var(--ink-950); color: var(--aqua-300); border: 1px solid var(--ink-800); border-radius: 6px; padding: 6px; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
    .mini .board .n { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 800; color: var(--aqua-400); }
    .mini .aqua { color: var(--aqua-400); }
    .mini .hair { border-top: 1px solid var(--mist); }
    .mini.ink .hair { border-color: var(--ink-800); }
    .mini .marklet { width: 34px; height: 34px; object-fit: contain; }
    .mini .grid3 { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 2fr 1.2fr 1fr; gap: 4px; }
    .mini .grid2 { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 6px; }
    .mini .frame { border: 2px solid var(--ink-800); border-radius: 10px; padding: 5px; background: #fff; color: var(--ink-950); }
    .mini .stamp { display: inline-block; border: 1.5px solid var(--green); color: var(--green); border-radius: 4px; padding: 0 4px; font-weight: 800; font-size: 8px; transform: rotate(-4deg); }
    .mini .badge { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 3px; border-radius: 99px; padding: 1px 6px; font-size: 8.5px; font-weight: 700; vertical-align: middle; }
    .mini .badge.g { border: 1px solid var(--green); color: var(--green); background: #fff; }
    .mini .badge.i { background: var(--ink-950); color: var(--aqua-200); }
    .mini .badge.m { border: 1px solid var(--mist); color: var(--slate); background: #fff; }
    .mini .scene { position: relative; height: 100%; min-height: 90px; }
    .mini .sq { position: absolute; width: 9px; height: 9px; border-radius: 2px; background: var(--ink-900); border: 1px solid var(--aqua-300); }
    .mini .slip { position: absolute; background: #fff; border: 1px solid var(--mist); border-radius: 2px; padding: 2px 5px; font-size: 9px; box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(4, 26, 26, 0.12); }
    .mini .bento { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.4fr 1fr 1fr; grid-template-rows: 1fr 1fr; grid-template-areas: "a b b" "a c d" ; gap: 4px; height: 100%; }
    .mini .bento .tile:nth-child(5), .mini .bento .tile:nth-child(6) { display: none; }
    .mini .step { border: 1px solid var(--teal-600); color: var(--teal-700); border-radius: 99px; padding: 2px 6px; font-weight: 700; font-size: 8.5px; white-space: nowrap; }
    .mini .ln { flex: 1; border-top: 1px solid var(--teal-600); min-width: 6px; }
    .mini .bar { display: inline-block; width: 22px; height: 9px; background: repeating-linear-gradient(90deg, var(--ink-950) 0 1px, transparent 1px 3px, var(--ink-950) 3px 5px, transparent 5px 6px); }
    .mini .ring { position: relative; height: 100%; min-height: 96px; }
    .mini .ring::before { content: ""; position: absolute; inset: 10% 8%; border: 1.5px solid var(--teal-600); border-radius: 50%; }
    .mini .hub { position: absolute; left: 50%; top: 50%; transform: translate(-50%, -50%); background: var(--ink-950); color: var(--aqua-200); border-radius: 99px; padding: 2px 7px; font-weight: 700; font-size: 9px; }
    .mini .node { position: absolute; background: #fff; border: 1px solid var(--mist); border-radius: 99px; padding: 1px 5px; font-size: 8.5px; }
    .mini .qr { display: inline-block; width: 22px; height: 22px; background: repeating-conic-gradient(var(--ink-950) 0 25%, #fff 0 50%) 0 0 / 6px 6px; border: 2px solid #fff; outline: 1px solid var(--mist); }
    .mini .sign { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px; background: var(--ink-950); color: #F2FBFA; border-radius: 6px; padding: 8px; box-shadow: inset 0 0 18px rgba(64, 232, 224, 0.25); }
    .mini .msg { display: inline-block; border-radius: 10px; padding: 4px 7px; font-size: 9px; max-width: 100%; }
    .mini .msg.them { background: #fff; border: 1px solid var(--mist); align-self: flex-start; }
    .mini .msg.me { background: var(--ink-950); color: var(--aqua-200); align-self: flex-end; }
    .mini .slot { margin-top: auto; border: 1px dashed var(--mist); border-radius: 6px; padding: 6px; color: var(--slate); font-size: 9px; text-align: center; }
    .mini .rung { display: inline-block; width: 10px; height: 10px; border-radius: 99px; background: var(--teal-600); }
    .mini.strips { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px; padding: 6px; }
    .mini.strips .s { flex: 1; border-radius: 3px; background: var(--paper); border: 1px solid var(--mist); font-size: 8.5px; padding: 0 6px; display: flex; align-items: center; color: var(--slate); }
    .mini.strips .s.alt { background: var(--wash-50); }
    .mini.strips .s.ink { background: var(--ink-950); color: var(--aqua-200); border-color: var(--ink-800); flex: 1.6; }
    .mini.strips .s.ink2 { background: var(--ink-900); color: var(--mist-on-ink); border-color: var(--ink-800); }
    .type-a { font-family: 'Manrope Variable', sans-serif; } .bn-a { font-family: 'Anek Bangla Variable', sans-serif; }
    .type-b { font-family: 'Figtree Variable', sans-serif; } .bn-b { font-family: 'Hind Siliguri', sans-serif; }
    .type-c { font-family: 'Hanken Grotesk Variable', sans-serif; } .bn-c { font-family: 'Noto Sans Bengali Variable', sans-serif; }
    .picksbar { position: sticky; bottom: 0; z-index: 30; background: var(--ink-950); color: #F2FBFA; padding: 10px 16px; display: flex; gap: 12px; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; border-top: 1px solid var(--ink-800); }
    .picksbar code { background: var(--ink-900); padding: 6px 10px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 13px; color: var(--aqua-200); flex: 1; min-width: 200px; }
    .picksbar button { background: var(--marigold); color: var(--ink-950); border: 0; border-radius: 10px; padding: 10px 14px; font-weight: 700; min-height: 44px; cursor: pointer; }
  </style>

  <script>
    const sections = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-key]'));
    const picks: Record<string, string> = {};
    const codes = document.getElementById('codes')!;
    const count = document.getElementById('count')!;
    const copy = document.getElementById('copy') as HTMLButtonElement;
    function render() {
      const list = sections.map((s) => picks[s.dataset.key!]).filter(Boolean);
      codes.textContent = list.length ? list.join(', ') : 'No picks yet';
      count.textContent = `${list.length} of ${sections.length}`;
    }
    try {
      Object.assign(picks, JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('lc-picks') || '{}'));
      for (const [k, v] of Object.entries(picks)) {
        document.querySelector(`[data-key="${k}"] .card[data-code="${v}"]`)?.classList.add('sel');
      }
    } catch {}
    document.addEventListener('click', (e) => {
      const btn = (e.target as HTMLElement).closest('.choose');
      if (!btn) return;
      const card = btn.closest('.card') as HTMLElement;
      const sec = card.closest('[data-key]') as HTMLElement;
      sec.querySelectorAll('.card').forEach((c) => c.classList.remove('sel'));
      card.classList.add('sel');
      picks[sec.dataset.key!] = card.dataset.code!;
      try { localStorage.setItem('lc-picks', JSON.stringify(picks)); } catch {}
      render();
    });
    copy.addEventListener('click', async () => {
      try {
        await navigator.clipboard.writeText(codes.textContent || '');
        copy.textContent = 'Copied';
        setTimeout(() => (copy.textContent = 'Copy picks'), 1500);
      } catch {}
    });
    render();
  </script>
</Base>
